     The vvmm__mmaapp__ggrroowwssttaacckk() function returns KERN_SUCCESS if _a_d_d_r is already
     mapped, or if the stack was grown successfully.

     It also returns KERN_SUCCESS if _a_d_d_r is outside the stack range; this is
